ision_requested","facts":{"gatewayOnline":true,"feedbackAttached":true},"scope":{"repo":"MADVenturesLLC/founder-os-build-room","paths":["README.md"],"roomId":"e006e499-58a4-4392-a624-e6170a393e36"},"eventId":"evt_bcde9eb2-d648-47ab-a926-a07804f87325","evidence":[{"ref":"cmd_planner_4d8dafcc80c49df73e1be3e5e99360e1","kind":"plandoc","digest":"c421cf1e857b92b8e16a8df958886e041cd26ee87f60f76cb800437ad51968f3"},{"ref":"evt_bcde9eb2-d648-47ab-a926-a07804f87325","kind":"founder_feedback","digest":"d8d29adfe705a9785a37547f72c63e283ad6743789160c03944640e18bbdeef7"}],"feedback":"Revise. Checked against the checkout at 6b80c2259558e93d4f12dca474cc1d491930bd5d, these statements are false. Correct each as stated here, or remove it, and keep the rest as it is.\n1. FOUNDER-ACT-20261031-PHASE4-STEPS-3-6, FOUNDER-ACT-20261103-AGY-PLANNER and FOUNDER-ACT-20261108-PHASE4-CR1 appear nowhere in the repository. Name only act identifiers that appear in the repository's files, or describe the change without an identifier.\n2. packages/madbridge-consumed/src/adapter/adapter-v1.ts exports only interfaces (ConfigChangeSet, LaunchInput, ManagedExecution, ExecutionIdentity, AdapterV1), and packages/control-plane/src/planner-loop.ts imports only the type ExecutionIdentity from it. DISPATCH_POLICY and retryBudgetTransition come from packages/seat-registry/src/dispatch-policy.ts. authorizeRoute is a dependency field of PlannerLoop (a CompletionAuthorizationResolver), not a madbridge export. ROUTE_MISMATCH_ERROR does not exist.\n3. scripts/verify-check.sh does not read README.md or .github/workflows/ci.yml. It runs a declared set of checks (path-audit, attribution-selftest, typecheck) and counts a check that could not run as failing. Remove every claim that it inspects the Verifying section or ties README commands to CI, and the risk that rests on it.\n4. Nothing is named founderGoal. T1 carries a goal string. prepareFounderGoal (packages/control-plane/src/founder-goal.ts lines 50-73) checks only that the goal is a non-empty string within FOUNDER_GOAL_MAX_LENGTH that carries no credential-shaped text, then adds its digest as founder_goal evidence. It does not check the repository, the base commit or the scope paths.\n5. POST /control-plane/rooms/:roomId/plan-decision takes decision (not eventType), planHash, feedback, eventId, and a required attribution object with actualModel and executionSurface.\n6. T5 (plan.approved) moves the room to BUILDING, and T22 (founder.cancel) moves it to CLOSED_ABANDONED. There are no APPROVED or CANCELLED states.\n7. AgyPlannerExecutor does not reject a run that uses a non-read tool; no code in packages/gateway-daemon inspects tool use. Describe only what the executor enforces: its pinned arguments, which include --mode plan and --sandbox, the agy hash check, the planner user, the reap and the halt.\n8. The planner.plan_refused log line is a JSON object with level, at (planner.plan_refused), ts, roomId, commandId, classification and reason. It has no event key and no attempt.\n9. PlannerRuntime does not exist; the control plane's planner interface is PlannerPort. GatewayPlannerWorker calls executor.start, not executor.execute.\n10. Line references: GOVERNED_PATH_EVENTS is at packages/control-plane/src/governed-events.ts lines 27-33; packages/gateway-daemon/src/agy-planner-executor.ts has 2003 lines, not 800; the side-track packages paragraph and list in README.md are at lines 34-47.\n11. npm run phase4:counted-run requires six variables, not two: PHASE4_TERMS_FILE, PHASE4_TERMS_SHA256, PHASE4_EVIDENCE_DIR, CONTROL_PLANE_TOKEN, PHASE4_COUNTED_RUN_TOKEN and FOUNDEROS_PATH (packages/run-harness/src/phase4/cli.ts line 93).\nChange nothing the feedback does not name; copy every hash and path from the earlier plan exactly.\nBefore returning the plan, check every name, line number and claim about behaviour against the files you read, and remove any you did not see.","occurredAt":"2026-11-12T21:14:41.939Z","attribution":{"roleId":null